Package: chRonostatistics
Title: Chronological Variograms for Process Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Matt", "Clauson",
    email = "matthewclauson@outlook.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(Affiliation = "Clauson Geometallurgy Consultancy"))
Description: Implements Gy and Pitard style chronological variograms, integral
    transforms, variance-component decompositions, engineering control limits,
    and reproducible process simulations. The methodology is informed by
    Napier-Munn (2025) <https://jktech.com.au/statsbook> and Pitard
    (2019) <doi:10.1201/9781351105934>.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ClausonGeomet/chRonostatistics-r
